      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SON OF RUPEE (7) comes off an average run last start when eighth at this track over 457m behind Rockatansky (27.23) in a Grade 6. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Looks the one to beat on his best form. JADA HAYZE (6) looks close to another win after finishing second last time (25.59) in a Grade 6 at this track. Has good speed so she should be prominent despite the draw. Overdue and expected to feature again. MULTIPLE (2) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when seventh at Bendigo over 500m behind Patty Bouvier (29.22) in a Rank Limit - Restricted Win. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Worth another chance. BIG GRIN (4) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
